  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Konfigurasi Body Field",
      "id": "details-body-field",
      "intro": "Sub-tab Body Field mengelola struktur data payload atau isi dari transaksi XLSX. Khusus untuk Message Type berjenis BULK_TRANSACTION, panel ini menyediakan pengaturan tambahan terkait file upload seperti ukuran maksimum, ekstensi yang diizinkan, dan batasan eksekusi batch.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Daftar & Detail Body Field",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Tabel body field menampilkan struktur mapping transaksi XLSX. Berbeda dengan antarmuka JSON, XLSX memiliki format flat, sehingga tidak menggunakan tipe data bersarang (OBJECT/ARRAY_OBJ).\n• Untuk tipe pesan **BULK_TRANSACTION**, tabel ini akan menampilkan baris konfigurasi file upload (biasanya dengan nama field `fileData`).\n• Informasi kolom mencakup:\n  - **Field Name & Description:** Nama dan kegunaan parameter.\n  - **Type & Length:** Tipe data (STRING, NUMERIC, DATE) dan panjang maksimum.\n  - **DER:** Status kewajiban field (MANDATORY, OPTIONAL, CONDITIONAL).",
          "color": "#107c41",
          "bg": "#f0fdf4",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.08);border:1px solid #bbf7d0;background:#fff;width:300px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:#f0fdf4;\"><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Body Field</span><span style=\"padding:3px 8px;border-radius:5px;background:#107c41;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">+ Add</span></div><div style=\"padding:0;\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:9px;\"><tr style=\"background:#f8fafc;\"><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;\">Field</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;\">Type</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;\">Len</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;\">DER</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;color:#0f172a;font-weight:600;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;\">fileData</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;\"><span style=\"padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(217,119,6,.1);font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#d97706;\">FILE</span></td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;color:#64748b;\">0</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;\"><span style=\"padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(239,68,68,.1);font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#dc2626;\">M</span></td></tr></table></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Form Tambah / Edit Body Field",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\nDrawer form memiliki variasi field tergantung pada *Message Type* yang dipilih sebelumnya:\n\n**Untuk Message Type Standar:**\nMenampilkan form input dasar seperti *Field Name*, *Description*, *Length*, *Sequence*, *Data Type*, dan *DER*.\n\n**Khusus untuk Message Type BULK_TRANSACTION:**\nForm (berukuran 550px) akan menampilkan blok pengaturan unggah file tambahan di bagian bawah:\n1. **Max File Size:** Ukuran maksimum file upload. Tersedia konversi satuan dropdown pintar (Bytes, KB, MB) dengan batas maksimum 100 MB.\n2. **Max Occurrence:** Jumlah baris/transaksi XLSX maksimum yang dapat diproses dalam satu kali *batch execution* (maksimal 10).\n3. **Allowed Extensions:** Pilihan jenis file yang valid (biasanya diatur sebagai `XLSX`).\n4. **Is File:** Flag indikator file upload (dikunci pada nilai YES).",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.1);border:1px solid #bbf7d0;background:#fff;width:280px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #bbf7d0;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f0fdf4,#dcfce7);\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:#107c41;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M4 22h14a2 2 0 002-2V7.5L14.5 2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v4\"/><polyline points=\"14 2 14 8 20 8\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Create Body Field</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">Fill in the body field details</div></div></div></div><div style=\"padding:10px 14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;font-size:9.5px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Field Name <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></span><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:5px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:9px;\">fileData</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:4px;padding-top:6px;border-top:1px dashed #cbd5e1;\"><div style=\"flex:2;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Max File Size</span><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-right:none;border-radius:5px 0 0 5px;color:#0f172a;font-size:9px;flex:1;\">50</div><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:0 5px 5px 0;background:#f1f5f9;color:#475569;font-size:9px;\">MB</div></div></div><div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Max Occur</span><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:5px;color:#0f172a;font-size:9px;\">10</div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Extensions</span><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:5px;color:#0f172a;font-size:9px;\">XLSX</div></div><div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Is File</span><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:5px;background:#f8fafc;color:#64748b;font-size:9px;\">YES</div></div></div></div><div style=\"padding:8px 14px;border-top:1px solid #bbf7d0;display:flex;gap:6px;\"><button style=\"flex:1;padding:5px;border-radius:5px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;color:#475569;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;\">Cancel</button><button style=\"flex:1;padding:5px;border-radius:5px;background:#107c41;border:none;color:#fff;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;\">Create</button></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
